   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Brian!<div><br></div><div>Thank you for your rapid reply. My first attempt to find the slots used in <font face=\"courier new, monospace\">self</font> was to look at <font face=\"courier new, monospace\">str(myplot)</font> and <font face=\"courier new, monospace\">ggplot_build(myplot)</font><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\">, without success. They must be hidden deeper down </font><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\">(or further sideways...)</span><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"> </span><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\">than I have dug so far. Or I might have misunderstood the R5 concept entirely...</font></div><div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\">Cheers</font></div></div>"
    ],
    [
