ce:pre\">$</span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);white-space:pre\">get_limits(), </span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);white-space:pre\">self</span><span style=\"color:rgb(167,29,93);white-space:pre\">$</span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);white-space:pre\">breaks, </span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);white-space:pre\">self</span><span style=\"color:rgb(167,29,93);white-space:pre\">$</span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);white-space:pre\">break_positions()</span></font><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;white-space:pre\">. </span></font><span style=\"font-size:small\">&quot;</span><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" style=\"font-size:small\">self&quot; </font><font style=\"font-size:small\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\">is mentioned in </font><span style=\"font-size:small\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&quot;courier new&quot;,monospace;font-size:small;white-space:pre\">?ggroto, </span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:small;white-space:pre\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\">but I fail to find information about the slots the way they are used in the ggplot code.</font></span><div><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);white-space:pre\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><br></font></span></font></div><div><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);white-space:pre\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\">Can someone please point me to relevant documentation of </font></span></font><span style=\"font-size:small\">&quot;</span><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" style=\"font-size:small\">self</font><span style=\"font-size:small\">&quot; and its different slots.  </span><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);white-space:pre\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\"> </font></span></font></div></div>\r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n</blockquote></div></div></blockquote></div></div>"
    ]
