016 8:52:41 AM GMT+02:00, Henrik &lt;<a rel=\"nofollow\">henri...@gmail.com</a>&gt; escribió:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\"><font size=\"2\">In the source code of ggplot, it is often refered to a &quot;<font face=\"courier new, monospace\">self </font>object&quot; and different slots therein. For example, in <a href=\"https://github.com/hadley/ggplot2/blob/master/R/scale-.r\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/hadley/ggplot2/blob/master/R/scale-.r&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792367674622000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3Rzcpu5MzbgY4vU88wOwJp\">scale-.r</a> we find, among others, <font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);white-space:pre-wrap\">self</span><span style=\"color:rgb(167,29,93);white-space:pre-wrap\">$</span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);white-space:pre-wrap\">get_limits(), </span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);white-space:pre-wrap\">self</span><span style=\"color:rgb(167,29,93);white-space:pre-wrap\">$</span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);white-space:pre-wrap\">breaks, </span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);white-space:pre-wrap\">self</span><span style=\"color:rgb(167,29,93);white-space:pre-wrap\">$</span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);white-space:pre-wrap\">break_positions()</span></font><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;white-space:pre-wrap\">. </span></font><span style=\"font-size:small\">&quot;</span><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" style=\"font-size:small\">self&quot; </font><font style=\"font-size:small\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\">is mentioned in </font><span style=\"font-size:small\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&quot;courier new&quot;,monospace;font-size:small;white-space:pre-wrap\">?ggroto, </span><span style=\"color:rgb(